### Credit Score API - click "Send Request" above each request (needs the REST Client extension)
### Start the API first:  Run and Debug -> "1. Run API (FastAPI)"

@host = http://127.0.0.1:8000

### Health check
GET {{host}}/health

### Model information
GET {{host}}/model-info

### Predict one customer (expected: Good)
POST {{host}}/predict
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "Month": "January",
  "Age": 28,
  "Occupation": "Scientist",
  "Annual_Income": 19114.12,
  "Monthly_Inhand_Salary": 1824.84,
  "Num_Bank_Accounts": 3,
  "Num_Credit_Card": 4,
  "Interest_Rate": 3,
  "Num_of_Loan": 4,
  "Type_of_Loan": "Auto Loan, Credit-Builder Loan, Personal Loan, and Home Equity Loan",
  "Delay_from_due_date": 3,
  "Num_of_Delayed_Payment": 7,
  "Changed_Credit_Limit": 11.27,
  "Num_Credit_Inquiries": 4,
  "Credit_Mix": "Good",
  "Outstanding_Debt": 809.98,
  "Credit_Utilization_Ratio": 26.82,
  "Credit_History_Age": "22 Years and 9 Months",
  "Payment_of_Min_Amount": "No",
  "Total_EMI_per_month": 49.57,
  "Amount_invested_monthly": 80.42,
  "Payment_Behaviour": "High_spent_Small_value_payments",
  "Monthly_Balance": 312.49
}

### Predict a risky customer (high debt, many delays, bad mix)
POST {{host}}/predict
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "Age": 35,
  "Annual_Income": 22000,
  "Monthly_Inhand_Salary": 1700,
  "Num_Bank_Accounts": 8,
  "Num_Credit_Card": 9,
  "Interest_Rate": 28,
  "Num_of_Loan": 7,
  "Delay_from_due_date": 45,
  "Num_of_Delayed_Payment": 22,
  "Num_Credit_Inquiries": 12,
  "Credit_Mix": "Bad",
  "Outstanding_Debt": 4200,
  "Credit_Utilization_Ratio": 40,
  "Credit_History_Age": 40,
  "Payment_of_Min_Amount": "Yes",
  "Payment_Behaviour": "Low_spent_Small_value_payments"
}

### Batch prediction
POST {{host}}/predict/batch
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "records": [
    {"Age": 28, "Credit_Mix": "Good", "Outstanding_Debt": 500, "Interest_Rate": 4},
    {"Age": 45, "Credit_Mix": "Bad", "Outstanding_Debt": 4000, "Interest_Rate": 30}
  ]
}
